# Simple Hello World Webpage

## Overview
Build a simple static HTML webpage that displays "HELLO!" in large text.

## Requirements
- Single HTML file: `index.html`
- Display "HELLO!" in the center of the page
- Large, bold text
- Clean, minimal styling
- No external dependencies
- Responsive design

## Technical Specs
- HTML5 doctype
- Centered content (horizontally and vertically)
- Font size: 72px or larger
- Text color: bright blue (#0066cc)
- Background: white
- Font family: system fonts (Arial, sans-serif)

## Testing
- File should be valid HTML5
- Should display correctly in any modern browser
- Text should be centered both horizontally and vertically
- Should work without internet connection (no CDN dependencies)

## Success Criteria
- Single `index.html` file created
- Opens in browser and displays "HELLO!" prominently
- Clean, readable code
- No console errors
